+=head1 DOWNSTREAM DOCUMENTATION NOTICE
+
+openEuler packaging, 2026-10-04: this notice documents the inherited
+File::Find options, preprocess/postprocess and wanted-function POD.
+Adaptations rename find/finddepth to walk/walkdepth and describe data nodes
+instead of files; filesystem-only options are ignored. No executable code
+or default test is changed. Guido Flohr's own LGPL-2.0-or-later grant is
+retained; inherited Perl prose is not relicensed to LGPL.
