+perl-5.8.7-README, perl-5.8.7-Artistic and perl-5.8.7-Copying.
+See PERL-POD-ORIGIN for the scope, differences and freely available
+modification/source route (Artistic 3(a), 4(b)).
+Reference, not proof of exact ancestry: official Perl 5.8.7 commit
+3eef4faaf8d7fa185749184afd7dc737b8039f42, lib/File/Find.pm:
+L<https://github.com/Perl/perl5/blob/3eef4faaf8d7fa185749184afd7dc737b8039f42/lib/File/Find.pm>.
